<section class="section claude" id="claude">
  <div class="section-inner claude-inner">
    <div class="split-head">
      <h2 class="section-title">Build, side&nbsp;by&nbsp;side, with AI <span class="claude-dot">*</span></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Drop the Proper skill into your skills folder and your AI agent will
        scaffold, edit, and refactor your app the Proper way.
        The strong conventions will guide it and keep it from making a mess.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="cmd">
<span class="c"># Step one: download the skill.</span>
<span class="p">$ </span>curl -LsSfO https://properproject.org/skill.zip
<span class="p">$ </span>unzip skill.zip -d ~/.claude

<span class="c"># Step two: ask, plainly, for a thing.</span>
<span class="p">$ </span>cd myapp
<span class="p">$ </span>claude
<span class="cl">&gt; </span>add an OAuth login
    </div>
  </div>
</section>